silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_flat_sections_14_factorization_contract_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '14FactorizationContractYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Page-Specific Factorization and Commuting Conditions' the universal_mediator arrow witnesses the unique mediating morphism from the Mittens colimit to the VetCarePlan_77 cocone, witnessing universality of the colimit assembly; this typed leg is load-bearing for the factorization step of the topology-JEPA pipeline." .
